@baseUrl = http://localhost:5079

### Check API health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Read the OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### List destinations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/destinations
Accept: application/json

### Search destinations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/destinations?search=Lisbon&category=Coast
Accept: application/json

### Get one destination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/destinations/1
Accept: application/json